  m_text: "DEVELOPMENT TEAM\r\n\r\nRegan \u2013 Programmer & AI Designer  \r\nRifky
    Agung Ardian \u2013 Environment Designer, VFX Designer & UI Designer  \r\nJihan
    \u2013 Animator & SFX Designer\r\nKayla \u2013 Character Designer, 3D Modeler
    & SFX Designer\r\n\r\nEXTERNAL ASSETS & RESOURCES\r\n\r\nHands \u2013 sergiovasquez
    (Freesound) \r\nMetal Pole Rubbing Creaking \u2013 SpliceSound (Freesound) \r\nPaper
    Slide Short \u2013 vjgalaxy \r\nSpray Paint \u2013 sKydran (Freesound) \r\nDJ
    Scratch 02 \u2013 vjgalaxy \r\nDJ Scratch Sound \u2013 Bennyx \r\nSelect 004
    - CreatorsHome\r\ntimer_countdown - u_lfmkadc0ha\r\nShort Crowd Cheer - qubodup
    (Freesound)\r\nHTF Blood Splatter Explode - RAGECore29\r\nSwoosh 017 - Universfield\r\nScratch
    Hit 120bpm - Pixabay\r\nWheel Spin Click Slow Down - pooky1 (Freesound)\r\nretro_gaming
    FX I - efectirijillo (Freesound)\r\nah yeah scratch things w eko 2 - .Andre_Onate
    (Freesound)\r\nConcrete Footsteps - mypantsfelldown (Freesound)\r\n\r\n\r\nBGM\r\nFunk
    Vlog \u2013 Kulakovka\r\nPositive Funk \u2013 Kulakovka\r\nHip Hop Background
    Version 4 \u2013 BombinSound\r\n\r\nAll audio assets sourced from Pixabay. \r\n\r\nProject
    ini dibuat dalam rangka Project-Based Learning.\r\nKerja sama antara Politeknik
    Negeri Jakarta dan Agate Academy.\r\n\xA9 2026 Graffiti Chase Tag\r\n"
